1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,203
The seventh arc closed with a scheme that fitted into a bucket.

2
00:00:03,203 --> 00:00:14,481
Ten fields, a pause on the launch, and a capacity of one page: the implementation of the new form was so small that the director laughed.

3
00:00:14,481 --> 00:00:19,451
“A scientist would call this a minor result,” he said.

4
00:00:19,451 --> 00:00:23,850
“A physicist would call it a clean one.”

5
00:00:23,850 --> 00:00:28,119
The route to the review was even shorter than they expected.

6
00:00:28,119 --> 00:00:39,527
A mistake in the old category list, a loss of two weeks, and an enormous inquiry from the national office: none of it changed the output.

7
00:00:39,527 --> 00:00:48,300
“Specify the minimum, assign the maximum, and fill the rest with nothing,” Maya said.

8
00:00:48,300 --> 00:01:01,717
The housing of the servers, the continuous hum of the virtual machines, and the aged lorry that brought the new equipment: the physical part of the system had a duration of about ten years.

9
00:01:01,717 --> 00:01:08,076
“Put the restriction in the code, not in the contract,” the engineer said.

10
00:01:08,076 --> 00:01:12,646
“Compatibility is a promise we can keep.”

11
00:01:12,646 --> 00:01:19,074
The contamination of one dataset by another was a small bomb in the middle of the file.

12
00:01:19,074 --> 00:01:22,949
“We can undo this,” the analyst said.

13
00:01:22,949 --> 00:01:36,141
“We cannot undo a person's loss of trust with a query.” The quantity of champagne ordered for the launch was, in the end, a minus rather than a plus.

14
00:01:36,141 --> 00:01:41,660
The group came back to the same question: who is the system for?

15
00:01:41,660 --> 00:01:50,073
The wait at the entrance, the level of detail on the form, and the clear view of the exit were the whole answer.

16
00:01:50,073 --> 00:02:00,851
“If it includes us, it will include the person after us,” Lin said, and followed the last line of the report to its end.

17
00:02:00,851 --> 00:02:10,979
The inquiry would continue, the national list would grow, and the next period would begin with a smaller system than the one they had pulled apart.

18
00:02:10,979 --> 00:02:16,373
That was the result they could put in front of the board — and the one they could defend.

19
00:02:16,373 --> 00:02:30,630
The difference between a scheme and a mistake is the loss it can absorb; the route to the review, the category of the output, and the housing of the servers all had to fit inside a capacity of one page.

20
00:02:30,630 --> 00:02:40,048
The national inquiry would expand, the restriction would be specified, and our continuous coverage would be measured in weeks.

21
00:02:40,048 --> 00:02:53,050
A quota every week, an upright posture at the desk, and a frequency of ten checks a month would imply a smaller and cleaner system, and nothing here would kill the project.

22
00:02:53,050 --> 00:02:59,859
The start of the next period would be smaller, and that was the point of the whole exercise.

23
00:02:59,859 --> 00:03:08,403
The system remembered less and the trust grew; that was the only exchange rate that ever worked.
